OL,3,GNEWSARapist jailed after 'campaign of
OL,4,Aviolence'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains details of
OL,7,Fviolence which some people may find
OL,8,Fdistressing
OL,10,FA "dangerous" man who carried out a
OL,11,F"campaign of violence" and subjected a
OL,12,Fwoman to years of physical and sexual
OL,13,Fabuse has been jailed for 19 years.
OL,15,FMartin Lloyd, 39, attacked the woman
OL,16,Fwith weapons including a machete,
OL,17,Fchains and a baseball bat resulting in
OL,18,Fa broken nose and leg injuries, West
OL,19,FMidlands Police said.
